== arena ==
Manage arenas
/arena [options] create | Create an arena | OPTIONS,LITERAL
/arena [options] <arena> join | Join the arena | OPTIONS,ARGUMENT,LITERAL
/arena [options] <arena> | Show an arena | OPTIONS,ARGUMENT
option [force] value=false
example /arena create lobby 16
== arena create ==
Create an arena
/arena create <name> [size] |  | ARGUMENT,ARGUMENT?
